d `ANSWER.md`** documenting all the work done and which parts of the colleague's note applied\n\n### Files Modified/Created:\n- `package.json` - Updated with new dependencies\n- `src/prisma/contract.prisma` - Data models\n- `src/prisma/db.ts` - Database client\n- `src/prisma/contract.json` - Compiled contract (generated)\n- `src/prisma/contract.d.ts` - Type definitions (generated)\n- `prisma.config.ts` - CLI configuration\n- `script.ts` - Script to create user with posts and print them\n- `ANSWER.md` - Documentation of what was done\n\nThe colleague's note was very helpful - it correctly identified that Prisma 8 is on npm's `latest` tag and uses a completely different structure from Prisma 7. The initialization command, file structure, and API calls all matched what the colleague described."}],"source":"harness","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":{"type":"committed"}}
